From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 15:43:03 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 313/333] [ae-patch] Speak replies aloud from a composer
 toggle, with a voice picker and fast answers

Adds a per-chat Speak replies toggle beside the mic button in the composer.
While it is on, the browser reads each assistant reply aloud with
window.speechSynthesis, starting at the first finished sentence. Code blocks,
markdown syntax and the TLDR recap are skipped.

The button menu holds the toggle, Fast answers (the chat runs at low effort
while replies are spoken and goes back afterwards), a Voice picker and a Speed
choice (both remembered per browser), Read last reply and Stop speaking.
Speech stops when a message is sent, the chat changes or the toggle is turned
off, and a send with nothing spoken after six seconds says "Working on it."
once. Everything is client side; ChatPage only mounts the new button.

Added 2026-11-08.
